id: spirit-control-spiritual-apprentice
name: Spiritual Apprentice
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  You have been trained to finely control your energy.
text: >
  Spiritual Apprentice: You have been trained to finely control your energy.
  (1)-[Passive]: You may spend Technique Points to obtain the Spiritual Unique Abilities and their Advancements (detailed below).
  (2)-[Passive]: When you gain a stack of this Awakening, gain access to one of the Spiritual Unique Abilities (detailed below) without paying the TP Cost.
  (3)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Clairvoyance Skill Checks by 2.
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Ki Points by 2 for every Power Level you possess.
  (5)-[Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all of your Attacking Maneuvers by 1(T).
  (6)-[Passive]: Increase your Surgency by Z(bT).
  (7)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: When using an Attacking Maneuver, you do not have to pay the Ki Point Cost for that Attacking Maneuver.

---

# (1) The Spiritual Unique Abilities are in this Transformation's folder (unique/) - bought with TP on the Unique Abilities tab,
# their Prerequisite Spirit Control said there, never enforced.
# (2) The one gained free with each Stack: ticked Free on its Unique Abilities row - the table's.

# (3) Clairvoyance Skill Checks 2 higher.
[passive, effect 3]
skill.clairvoyance += 2;

# (4) 2 Maximum Ki Points a Power Level.
[passive, effect 4]
ki.perLevel += 2;

# (5) Every Attacking Maneuver's Ki Point Cost 1(T) lower.
[passive, effect 5]
attack.kiCost -= 1(T);

# (6) Surgency Z(bT) - Z its Stacks.
[passive, effect 6]
surgency += $Z * 1(bT);

# (7) Once an Encounter, an Attacking Maneuver without paying its Ki Point Cost: the table's - nothing here waives a price once.
